# VHS tape for the README demo: https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs
# Run from the repository root:  vhs docs/demo/demo.tape
# Requires PATH to contain a `preflight` binary and $DEMO_DIR to hold the
# repository generated by make-demo-repo.sh (see docs/demo/record.sh).

Output docs/demo.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1040
Set Height 880
Set Padding 18
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.0

Hide
Type "cd $DEMO_DIR && clear"
Enter
Show

Sleep 800ms
Type "# A recruiter sent me a take-home assignment..."
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Type "cat README.md"
Enter
Sleep 2500ms

Type "# Before opening it in VS Code:"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Type "preflight scan . --min-severity high"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 10s
